OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance call case 'profoundly
OL,4,Adisturbing and should be looked at' -
OL,5,AJohn Swinney
OL,6,
OL,7,FScottish Labour's acting leader Jackie
OL,8,FBaillie raises the issue of ambulance
OL,9,Fcare and the case of Julie Parker who
OL,10,Fdied on her way to hospital after
OL,11,Fcollapsing at her Kilmarnock flat and
OL,12,Flying on the floor for days.
OL,14,FJohn Swinney says the case is
OL,15,F"profoundly disturbing and should be
OL,16,Flooked at" and his health secretary
OL,17,FAngela Constance would be meeting with
OL,18,FJulie Parker's family soon.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
