OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance call case 'profoundly
OL,4,Adisturbing and should be looked at' -
OL,5,AJohn Swinney
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform Scotland leader Malcolm Offord
OL,8,Fcriticises Swinney's "wee day trip to
OL,9,FWales" to meet the first ministers of
OL,10,FWales and Northern Ireland, adding he
OL,11,Fshould stop his campaign for
OL,12,Findependence and focus instead on the
OL,13,Fday job.
OL,15,FThe first minister says his government
OL,16,Fis concentrating on its four
OL,17,Fpriorities, including growing the
OL,18,Feconomy and improving public services,
OL,19,Fadding that those aims will thrive
OL,20,Ffurther if Scotland becomes
OL,21,Findependent.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
