OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance call case 'profoundly
OL,4,Adisturbing and should be looked at' -
OL,5,AJohn Swinney
OL,6,
OL,7,FScottish Conservative leader Russell
OL,8,FFindlay also raises the independence
OL,9,Fquestion arguing that Swinney wants to
OL,10,Fmake Scotland poorer and weaker by
OL,11,Fleaving the United Kingdom.
OL,13,FScottish Green co-leader Ross Greer's
OL,14,Fquestioning concentrates on data
OL,15,Fcentres. His party wants a moratorium
OL,16,Fon such facilities being built in
OL,17,FScotland.
OL,19,FYou can follow events in the Holyrood
OL,20,Fchamber by clicking on the Watch live
OL,21,Ficon at the top of this page
